#, fuzzy
msgid "Our fourth semi-annually Q&A session is happening."
msgstr "我们每半年举行一次的第四次答疑会即将开始。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We meant to do it this week but a case of covid made us take a small break! Instead we will do it on the coming Monday."
msgstr "我们本打算在本周内完成，但由于科维德病例，我们不得不稍作休息！我们将在下周一进行。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To submit questions comment on this blog or the matching post in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/discussions/26740[GitHub Discussion forum] or post a tweet using the hashtag https://twitter.com/hashtag/quarkusinsights[#quarkusinsights]."
msgstr "要提交问题，请在本博客或我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/discussions/26740[GitHub 讨论区] 中的相应帖子上发表评论，或使用 link:https://twitter.com/hashtag/quarkusinsights[#quarkusinsights] 标签发布推文。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "If an existing question is of interest do upvote questions found in our discussion or like a tweet and we'll use that to prioritize the questions."
msgstr "如果您对现有问题感兴趣，请为我们的讨论中发现的问题或推文点赞，我们将根据这些问题排定问题的优先顺序。"

